module Billing
  description "Billing context"
  documentation
    ```markdown
    # Boundary
    Billing owns invoice decisions, not delivery.
    ```
  feature Invoices
    documentation
      ```markdown
      Keep drafts separate from issued invoices.
      ```
    slice StateChange IssueInvoice
      documentation
        ```markdown
        ## Assumption
        The invoice identity belongs to the caller.
        ```
      command IssueInvoice
        documentation String
        documentation
          ```markdown
          Issuing records a fact; delivery is a separate decision.
          ```
        invoiceId Uuid identifier
        produces event InvoiceIssued
          note String = documentation
      readmodel InvoiceStatus
        documentation String
        documentation
          ```markdown
          This view answers whether issuance happened, not delivery.
          ```
      reaction ObserveIssuance
        documentation
          ```markdown
          A reaction observes issuance without changing its meaning.
          ```
        when InvoiceIssued
      specification IssuingAnInvoice
        description "Witnesses that issuing records the supplied note"
        when IssueInvoice
          invoiceId = "6db4f402-d7d0-4a5c-9065-cf71c1df5c24"
          documentation = "input"
        then InvoiceIssued
          note = "input"
      specification ExplainingTheCase
        description
          ```text
          This example explains a case over multiple lines.
          It is not an executable condition.
          ```
